1325
00:54:25,258 --> 00:54:26,728
- That was why they were inside. - Right.

1326
00:54:29,498 --> 00:54:31,268
I told him to change the batteries.

1327
00:54:31,268 --> 00:54:32,868
(Laughing)

1328
00:54:32,868 --> 00:54:34,638
They must feel upset if you change the passcode.

1329
00:54:36,238 --> 00:54:38,338
